          }
        }
      },
      {
        "text": {
          "text_content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "attrs": {},
            "uid": "c118163288f34fa5a73706e8d16448a1",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "93b0a342662b4ab48e64899fa80228d3",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Gemini Enterprise, Google Cloud's fastest-growing product ever, wins because it understands users' workflows and has the right context—exactly what Mosaic delivers for enterprise structured data."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "_version": 1
          },
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs6e772c04a69dd7c4"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "section_anchor": {
          "header_text": "What Comes Next, and Who Will Be Ready for It",
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs611ff6c6f4802f07"
          },
          "section_id": "what-comes-next-and-who-will-be-ready-for-it"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": {
          "text_content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "attrs": {},
            "uid": "da8855f85fb44a42a48076a5ae257923",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "5d03ae2f91b14057a31414d12cf231d2",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Everybody knows there's value in AI, but there are still so many opportunities to unlock the potential with it."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "06e4c253c69d49cbbceee0c163c5de08",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "For the industry:",
                    "bold": true
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Semantic layers are now table stakes for Agentic AI. The next wave is federated governance, real-time decisioning, and AI agents that orchestrate across multiple domains."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "d9df78b5850b4e88a41a12269e810150",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "For Strategy:",
                    "bold": true
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Mosaic continues to lead as the vendor-neutral semantic layer. 200+ connectors, MCP-native, and the only platform built for true multi-cloud portability."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "_version": 1
          },
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs0b6b7a3707f40bce"
          }
        }
      },
